  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Activity under preparation CSO Roadmap Events and information session for a call for proposals</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">&lt;p&gt;The EU Roadmap for Engagement with Civil Society (CSO Roadmap) (2021-24) is a joint process between the European Union and its Member States (Team Europe) in Zambia, to strengthen partnership with civil society and provide support to their endeavours. In order to proactively engage with civil society, it is apparent that CSO Events are organised at least bi-annually in a year.&lt;/p&gt;</narrative>
  </description>
